---
title: Confession of Sin
type: prayer
citation: BCP 360
rite: II
---

[Deacon] Let us confess our sins against God and our neighbor.
[Rubric] *Silence may be kept. Minister and People*
[People] **Most merciful God, we confess that we have sinned against you in thought, word, and deed, by what we have done, and by what we have left undone. We have not loved you with our whole heart; we have not loved our neighbors as ourselves.**

---

[People] **We are truly sorry and we humbly repent. For the sake of your Son Jesus Christ, have mercy on us and forgive us; that we may delight in your will, and walk in your ways, to the glory of your Name. Amen.**
